    {
      "source": "Apply <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> post-processing to an existing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>. This\nmethod can be useful when working with an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> that has been created\ndirectly and not necessarily as part of a <a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> 后处理应用于现有的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>。此方法在直接创建（而非作为 <a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a> 的一部分）的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 中工作时非常有用。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> post-processing to an existing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对现有的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 应用 <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> 后处理。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>environment</code> - the environment to apply <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> to",
      "translation": "<code>environment</code> - 要应用 <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> 的环境",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>bootstrapContext</code> - the bootstrap context to use or <code>null</code> to use a\nthrow-away context",
      "translation": "<code>bootstrapContext</code> - 要使用的引导上下文，或为 `null` 以使用一次性上下文。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>additionalProfiles</code> - any additional profiles that should be applied",
      "translation": "<code>additionalProfiles</code> - 应应用的其他配置文件",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - the resource loader to use",
      "translation": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - 要使用的资源加载器",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Property used to determine what action to take when a\n<code>ConfigDataLocationNotFoundException</code> is thrown.",
      "translation": "用于确定在抛出 <code>ConfigDataLocationNotFoundException</code> 时应采取何种操作的属性。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Post-process the given <code>environment</code>.",
      "translation": "后处理给定的<code>environment</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The default order for the processor.",
      "translation": "处理器的默认顺序。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a> that loads and applies <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> to Spring's\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "加载并应用 <a href=\"ConfigData.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.config\"><code>ConfigData</code></a> 到 Spring 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
